Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：血与沙》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《精致》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们经历过噩运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have seen misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尝过失败的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Felt the sting of defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道手中没钱 腹内空空的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The humility of vacant purse and empty stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人以为Batiatus家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some believed the House of Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能重振声威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would never reclaim its former glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我们将从人们的记忆中淡出 被历史抹除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we would fade from memory, forsaken by history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天 我们证实了他们的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we have proved them wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们证明了Batiatus之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have proved the name Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将万古长青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will live long after we have gone to dust and bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们自豪地 矗立在雨神面前!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So stand proud before the Bringer of Rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屠灭死亡之影的勇士!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Slayer of the Shadow of Death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡普亚的新战神!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The new champion of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯! 斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus! Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位勇士 他的胜利 空前绝后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Titan, his victory eclipsing all others!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解了我们的饥渴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quenching our thirst!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达成了我们的希望和梦想!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fulfilling our hopes and dreams!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他成为传奇的一刻 万众瞩目!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Behold the man, as he becomes legend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是个开始!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is only the beginning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你在 大业得成是迟早的事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will build an empire of blood and glory upon your name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打败Theokoles 可不是他一个人的功劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did not stand against Theokoles on his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有Crixus\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus is not forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他能活下来 自然有他一席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will always have position, if he survives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但目前 斯巴达克斯正当红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Spartacus is the name on the crowd's tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.50,0:02:37.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would see it spoken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再造佳绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with ever increasing amazement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打败了一个不败的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I defeated a man who could not be defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.46,0:02:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们还想我做什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What more could they expect of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做一切能做之事!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民众的欲望是无底洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their appetite is a great beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要不断尝鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must constantly be fed with new delights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就从改变你的角斗风格开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll start by changing your fighting style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像Theokoles一样 手执双剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two swords, as Theokoles fought with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,民众对你的喜爱之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll see the crowds pleasure double{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也会比Theokoles多一倍!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with their new hero twice as deadly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再穿件与传奇人物相称的 新战袍!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And new armor, worthy of a legend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让男人自惭形秽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men will be made to feel smaller by it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让女人春心荡漾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Women will moisten at the very sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, but I forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎对女人荡漾的春心不感兴趣 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has no hard purpose for just any wet thigh, does he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不管他对什么感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He and his purpose are not my concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好天神眷顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fortunately the gods feel otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们对他青眼有加 不惜普降甘霖来盛加赞扬...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They shower him with more than rain and accolades...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:26.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们庇佑他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They bless him with news to lift the heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,威名远播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}higher than the clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Found!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在叙利亚的某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the dark corners of Syria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她... 在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where... where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还好么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is she well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安然无恙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别急 听我说!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All will be revealed when a mouth closes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个叙利亚人Glaber 又把她卖给了一个商人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Syrian Glaber spoke of sold her to a merchant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他的情妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the sea his mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最近在那不勒斯靠过岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has recently docked on the shores of Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在罗马?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On Roman soil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的妻子和奴隶在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife among the slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出意外 2天就能赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two days ride from where you stand, barring incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们何时动身?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When do we leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样做好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it wise to allow such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的人已快马加鞭 你大可放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My man already spurs his horse, rest at ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们说话这会儿 她已经离我们越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She moves ever closer even as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个值得尊敬的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are an honorable man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.03,0:04:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永世感激你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And will forever bear my gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you bear mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你妻子团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Being reunited with your wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是第一个奖赏而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is but the first of many rewards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.63,0:04:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你瞒着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半点口风都没泄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Secrets upon secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是刚知道她被找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The news of her discovery only just reached me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius一家怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of good Ovidius and his family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么背着我 把他们都杀了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you keep plans towards their slaughter from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只为了减少点债务么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all to clear a few debts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟债务无关 是为了报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It had nothing to do with debt, except one of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是幕后凶手 意图在竞技赌场杀掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His was the hand behind attempt on my life in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius做的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ovidius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.23,0:04:50.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是Solonius授意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Moved to purpose by Solonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我瞒着你 不是怕你知道 而是出于爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I keep from you not out of secrecy, but from love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:05:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想让你为这些事担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have you stained by such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在是人们交相传唱的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are the toast of the fucking city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们尽情享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us pause and enjoy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你住的单间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有别人了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not to be shared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your achievement in earning it profound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:30.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没你的指导 不可能成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Made possible by your instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只帮你赢得了上场机会而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My actions only set you to the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但杀掉Theokoles\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By depriving Theokoles of his life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你替我完成了未尽之战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you put end to a battle left unfinished by my sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也结束了我羞耻的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An end to my shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏你 我才有活着见到妻子的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I live to see my wife again, because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个恩情我永世铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A debt not soon forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们之间不谈恩情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no balance between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要记得为荣誉而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only the promise of future glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以点蜡烛吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are candles permitted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura总喜欢点着蜡烛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura was always fond of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You misunderstand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This cell is for you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妻子不能和我们住在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wives are not permitted to live among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那她住哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then where will she stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.26,0:06:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保证生命安全 但作为回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kept safe and well in return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要服侍好主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for good service to the Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为奴隶来服侍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.70,0:06:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As are we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的地位升得太快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you rise quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.16,0:06:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和以往我所知道的任何一个人 都不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unlike any other I've ever witnessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续保持这势头 你就能获得自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Continue your ascent, and you will gain freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩都能自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是来找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was this very moment coming to have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿钱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have coin instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Theokoles会败 真是太让人吃惊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is no small marvel, the fall of Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么意外的结果 这么悬殊的赔率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wager in the favor of the unexpected outcome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下的注...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the size of the odds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要付清这么一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not a simple matter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是件容易的事 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cover a win of such margin, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么搞钱 我才不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give no shit for margins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去讨 去偷 或杀人越货 要搞钱容易得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beg, steal, or kill to cover what is owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则你就等着双腿残废吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or you will have two worthless legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中间那条也跟着废了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And nothing in between to prop yourself up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找过瘸子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had exchange with the cripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给钱了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He pays what is owed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钱很快就能到手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon the coin will be in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足以让我们换回自由之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough to buy our freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由 呃... 这个词对我来说 还真陌生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom, err... the word is foreign to the tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就不陌生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will learn to savor the taste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.73,0:08:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟儿们该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the birds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们也会像我们一样 重获自由的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will fly this place as we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看都有什么衣服可穿 准备一下为好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see what clothes we have packed and ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去往何方 要去多远的地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which direction shall we travel and how far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能走多远 是多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As far as desire wills our feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件斗篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This cloak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你走的时候 穿在身上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the one you wore when you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是Ovidius被杀的那个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When good Ovidius was murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:21.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他罪有应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was nothing good about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 是你杀了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then it was you who killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有他所有的奴隶?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All his slaves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及他的家人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His family...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听令行事而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hands did what they were commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of the young boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才那么小啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ovidius' son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也杀了他么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did they take his life too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.56,0:08:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听令行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such were my orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you know of my affection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对小东西的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for delicate things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小孩没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy was spared,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.10,0:08:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被送去了外地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and set to wander far from the deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等找到他的时候 我们早就是自由身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the time he is discovered, we will be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的双手呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此不再沾染鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clean forever more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只听你的吩咐...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yours to command...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的胜利 让整座城市为之沸腾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus' victory ignites the imagination of the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平民百姓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Orders for my men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家家户户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}flood in from every family with half a name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都为我的手下而倾倒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and a little coin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繁荣兴盛 触手可及!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Prosperity beyond measure is within our reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些想要你命的人 也近在咫尺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As are those who would have you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让Solonius付出代价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see Solonius pay for the grievance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这些急不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But these things are not be hurried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我用绳子绞紧他脖子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would savor every drop of sweat from his brow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:53.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽情享受他流出的每一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as my noose tightens upon his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望这一刻快点到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would prefer it tighten quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 瓜熟自会蒂落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eh, everything to its season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈点眼前的事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turning towards more pressing matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要让色雷斯人 夫妻团圆吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reuniting the Thracian with his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说的 不是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the matter I was referring to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那女奴玩一把 我想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have the girl's ass a bit and I'll watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让你大饱眼福的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would give pleasure to your eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,色雷斯人的老婆 总让我放心不下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Thracian woman concerns me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到她的那个承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The promise of finding her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是唯一能牵制他的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was the only thing that kept him in check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一她的出现 让他重新变得桀骜不驯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if her presence reverts him to his Thracian ways,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thoughts of defiance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何如此肯定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can you be so sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没看到他眼中的感激之泪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you see the tears of gratitude in his eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感激不及忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude falls short of loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.80,0:10:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是Crixus那样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not the man Crixus is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus也不是他这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Crixus is not the man he was,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远也不会是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and may never be again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯将和妻子团圆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus will be reunited with his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到那时...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in the act...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会让他离不开我们 和这个训练场...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will bind him to us and this ludus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非天神下令...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until god comes to claim us all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么救我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will you save us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说这场雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的胜利让天降甘霖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your victory splits the skies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们淹死前 你又怎么让雨停下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will you close them before we all drown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真跟他们一样傻?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe the rest of the fools, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.83,0:11:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以为我受天神庇佑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That I am blessed by the gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你身上 总有奇迹发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Miracles do take habit of shooting out of your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:05.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到些更匪夷所思的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've heard whispers of yet more divine providence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于Sura\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她正从那不勒斯 赶回到我的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She speeds to my arms from Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.23,0:12:14.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你仍不敢置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And still you doubt the god's favor you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果天神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If what Sura has been forced to endure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真要Sura受什么罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is parcel of their favor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:20.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿他们冲着我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would rather they turn their back on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果世上真有天神的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they exist at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is all that matters now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾经以自由之身 住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You once lived free in these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会从哪边来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From which way does she travel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不勒斯港在那个方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The port in Neapolis lies in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有朝东的路 可以上山吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are there roads to the mountains that lead east?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有几条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Several.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪几条最人迹罕至?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which ones are the most sparsely traveled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿这么怪的问题 来转换话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An odd question, removed from the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转换得不算成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not so far astray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 的确有些路人迹罕至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, some are sparsely traveled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果有人起疑的话 这些路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not to the point of the new champion of fucking Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚不足以令卡普亚的新战神 掩藏踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}going unnoticed, if overcome by questionable thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得 还要多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long do you think before Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus才能让我赎回自由?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would allow me to buy our freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:06.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要受多少年的折磨?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many years will she be condemned to bow and scrape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不干脆一死了之?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Death the alternative?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想逃出墙外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You move to escape beyond these walls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是这个下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that is surely what you'll find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.50,0:13:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道以前没有先例吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has no one ever attempted such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And lived?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不可能的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a thing born of the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前也说Theokoles不可战胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same was said of defeating Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.20,0:13:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经有计划了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a plan, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚成型...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One begins to take shape...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.63,0:14:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕它会胎死腹中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it malformed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In what way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weapons, to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个在训练场多得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In large supply at a ludus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 但锁着呢 你又没钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, but kept by lock and key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你以为天神会让钥匙 跟着雨一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or do you believe the gods will drop one from the sky{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}along with the rain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信天无绝人之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe in opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有能力拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the power of reason to seize upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想得真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fair enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你怎么去"拿"武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Say you somehow "reason" up a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of a horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有马 你连山的边儿 都碰不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll never reach the mountains without one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由主人提供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus provides one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura会坐马车回来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura arrives by cart...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 这无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well it won't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器 马 这些都是小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weapons, horses, they're the least of your concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还有什么大问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the greatest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把你拦下来的人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The one man that could stop you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没考虑过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had not considered him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欠考虑的事 多了去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have not considered many things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就此打住吧 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take pause, I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须要争得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will have our freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要拥她入怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will take her in my arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听她呢喃我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and hear her speak my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是罗马人硬加到我头上的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the one the Romans branded me with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot help you in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:01.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not ask it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不是为了我的家人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it weren't for my own family...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.26,0:16:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it no thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎样 才能让你悬崖勒马?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there nothing I can say to turn you from this path?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样都不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那愿上天保佑你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then may the gods you don't believe in favor you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神勇无比呢 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fine figure, is he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是天神下凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A god among men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过这么威武的战袍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never beheld such magnificent armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.86,0:17:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您允许的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you grant permission,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想穿着它 迎接我妻子的归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would wear it upon my wife's return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让她一见难忘?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A move to impress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会为她所看到的 惊叹不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will marvel at the sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男为悦己者所容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man must always appear his best in the eyes of love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿着它吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你张开双臂迎接她的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will even stand by your side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会站在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while you welcome her with your open arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 剑...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The swords, however...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:52.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要它们干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What need would I have of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.73,0:17:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰一下 行吗?!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can it be?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.23,0:18:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看看我们的传奇人物?!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The legend himself among us?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Calavius行政官!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Magistrate Calavius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到您 我真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good fortune to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.03,0:18:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是我很高兴才对!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, the good fortune is mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子Numerius一直念念不忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My son Numerius cannot cease his talk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 和他打败Theokoles的那一仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Spartacus and his victory over Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了向你的人表示敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He demanded a trip to market to obtain something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还去市场上 买了点色雷斯的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Thrace in your man's honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他瞧瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商人说 这是勇士之剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The merchant said it was a warrior's weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的确是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As well it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到这些标记吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See these marks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是色雷斯人刻在刀柄上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thracians notch their hilts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每杀一人 刻一道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One for every kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了Theokoles后 你在剑上刻了多少道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many made to yours after slaying Theokoles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少能以一抵十了吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He must have been worth ten at least!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我能有你一半的能力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I could wield a sword half as well you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到我主人的训练场来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join us at my master's ludus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会把干掉死亡之影的经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will teach you the blow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都教给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that brought death to the Shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:18:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多棒的主意啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A splendid notion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.96,0:19:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午晚点就过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps a visit later this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何必让小伙子忍到那时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why make the boy suffer with anticipation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Join us presently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种快活的事儿 还是先放放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Joy must be delayed in favor of sorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要去处理我堂弟被害的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I attend to matters relating my cousin's murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善良的Ovidius\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Ovidius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一想到这 就让人心就痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The heart constricts at the thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我现在满腔都是复仇之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But swells with promise of vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Numerius! 跟我走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Numerius! Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍后 我们再来赴你的盛情邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your generous hospitality will be appreciated shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.03,0:19:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邀请行政官的儿子来训练场?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An invitation to school the Magistrate's son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若是我冒失了 那真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, if I offered out of turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你的抱歉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck apologies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个鬼点子 我怎么就没想到!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shrewd maneuvering, if ever I saw it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我早给你弄个罗马人来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll make a Roman of you yet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能睁开眼吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should his eyes not be open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情绪要保持镇定 才能愈合伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm is needed to heal the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用药让他得以安睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I keep him at rest with herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will recover?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've done what I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.03,0:20:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听天命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It rests in the hands of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的命在你掌握之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His life now rests in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I will see them parted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.76,0:20:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你碎尸万段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from your fucking body if he dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到大家对你的喜爱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See how they all look at you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲有很多杰出的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father had many champions,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没一个能胜过斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but none to rival the great Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你几乎能听到金币落入口袋的响声了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can almost smell the coins dropping into our purse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有钱的话 抵消完Sura的交通费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I may, what remains of my own coin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有多少剩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Sura's transport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.53,0:20:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想给你老婆买点什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wish to buy something for your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的东西都是卖给罗马人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This market is for proper Romans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不适合奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it would not suit a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是为了自己 而是为其他角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask not for me, but for the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:56.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想弄些红酒和女人 来共庆我的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wine and women, in celebration of my victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做 能让人心悦臣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A noble gesture, to be much appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你花点儿钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pay with your own coin,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们开心开心 对我也有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet their happiness is a benefit to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就这么办吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well, let it be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 Marcellus能搞到这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, Marcellus is of sound choice towards the vice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我去找他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall I make arrangement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.43,0:21:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别花得太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See that there is ample remainder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走 为行政官的到来做准备去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, let us prepare for the Magistrate's arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来恐吓我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More threats then, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你钱 用来买红酒和女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coin, to the purpose of wine and whores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多得足够满足我主人的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enough to wet tongue and cock for my master's men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠了角斗士Barca很多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a large matter of debt to the gladiator Barca,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想请你帮我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I would ask assistance with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打不过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no hand for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的腰带 和那装饰品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your belt and adornments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会阻碍你发力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They hinder your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.13,0:22:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的战袍如此沉重 但你却能步履轻盈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your armor is heavy and yet you move swiftly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.36,0:22:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火候到了 你也可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In time, so will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真正的勇士 只需要一把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But a true warrior needs only a sword{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.66,0:22:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去挑战命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cleave his fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see your meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.06,0:22:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扮作Theokoles 我来呼风唤雨...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Play Theokoles, and I will attempt to bring the rains...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.33,0:22:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我们来晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for our late arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在堂弟那儿的调查进展 真是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My inquiry at my cousin's villa was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.03,0:22:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}overwhelming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you fare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.16,0:22:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只希望他一路走好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As expected when walking on dead relatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贵公子真是学剑奇才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your son is a quick study with the sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.30,0:22:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是为成为角斗士而生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Born of a fascination with gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他15岁生日快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His fifteenth birthday approaches,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听他说 想在生日会上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my ears are assaulted with request for a pair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看角斗士表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to show demonstration at his party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.80,0:23:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来还指望雇Solonius的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had thought to engage Solonius' men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.93,0:23:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但自从你的人打败了Theokoles后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but his wares have fallen out of fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的人显然已不值一提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since your victory over Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.80,0:23:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来贵公子喜欢时下强者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems your son has a taste for what is in favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望他能满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would see him well fed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.76,0:23:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 我们谈谈出场费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come. Let us negotiate a price for the meal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begging pardon, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.53,0:23:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有封信函 要呈给Calavius行政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bring word of great import to Magistrate Calavius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An important man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总不忘时刻关注民情!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}seldom out of reach of public matters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这消息与公众无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, this message strikes more personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius的儿子还活着!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ovidius' boy yet lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well this is fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上天庇佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By Jupiter's blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.73,0:23:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在卡普亚以北稍远的地方 发现了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was discovered miles north of Capua,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他当时正在路边游荡!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wandering the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of his words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.33,0:23:49.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说那天的现场惨状了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he describe the horrors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于他怎么活下来的细节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How he came to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.40,0:23:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前还不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Details not yet clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.70,0:23:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Numerius 我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Numerius, come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了你的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not forget your things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢指教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for the lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是无上荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was an honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.13,0:24:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Numerius啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Numerius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子怎么还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How can the boy still be alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He could not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:24.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你亲眼看他死的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eyes held his death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.76,0:24:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我交给Barca去处理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I left the deed in Barca's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.80,0:24:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的命 如今也攥在他手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And our lives as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.43,0:24:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are we going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.26,0:24:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠 动脑子想啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck. Think!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.36,0:24:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pardon the intrusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庆祝会的东西到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Provision for the celebration arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.80,0:24:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他的庆祝会!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cunt with celebration!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.60,0:24:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迦太基混蛋耍得我们团团转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are betrayed by the beast of fucking Carthage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.83,0:24:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却跑过来说酒和女人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you bray about wine and whores!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.16,0:24:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:50.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一向很忠诚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man has always been loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘恩负义的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a snake to the breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius的儿子还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The son of Ovidius lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太不幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunate news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子看到你的脸了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would the boy know your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.96,0:25:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 我在暗处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No I was in shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但Barca暴露在明处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Barca was clearly revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 Barca会背叛你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot believe Barca would betray you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.60,0:25:11.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也没想到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.90,0:25:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要能想到办法 就赶快说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you have knowledge, bring it to light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.73,0:25:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca赌Theokoles会输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca placed a wager against Theokoles,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.73,0:25:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赚了一大笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}winning sizeable coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.90,0:25:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无意中听到 他跟Pietros说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I overheard him whisper to Pietros{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.76,0:25:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算用这些钱帮他们自己赎身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}intentions to buy their freedom with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.86,0:25:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca从没提过 有离开这儿的想法呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca has never mentioned desire to leave these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想在事实败露前离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He seeks to fly before discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那孩子看到他的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the child is allowed to look upon his face,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.10,0:25:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被认出来 他是你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he will be known as your man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.26,0:25:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集合守卫 去带Barca回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather proper guard and return with Barca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:41.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要听听从他嘴里 说出来的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would hear truth spilled from his mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.63,0:25:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当一个人压力很大的时候 谎言会随口而出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When a man is pressed, lies flow with greater ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.33,0:25:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做掉他 就完事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}End him and be done with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.40,0:25:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我没亲眼看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not before I look into his eyes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是否背叛我之前 不能杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see if treachery lurks there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.40,0:25:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没准儿还有其他办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps there is another path to illumination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.40,0:25:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经验丰富的人 总是很敏感...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One traveled by more delicate sensibilities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.86,0:26:29.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天宿醉醒来 角斗士们反应会比较迟缓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow the men will be slow from drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.36,0:26:32.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一半的守卫也和他们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And half the guards with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.26,0:26:39.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中只有一个没有享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one that does not partake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你施予的乐趣...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in your joyous offerings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.50,0:26:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个原则性很强 不会轻易分心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man of higher principle, not so easily distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.33,0:26:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Crixus怎样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does Crixus fare?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.53,0:26:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在梦乡里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Adrift in the land of dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.30,0:26:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医师还在照料他呢 希望能康复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kept there yet by the Medicus, in hope of recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.50,0:27:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会前往致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would pay my respects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.66,0:27:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想淹死我啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You drown me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多酒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In more than just wine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.20,0:27:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pietros啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.20,0:27:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人召见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are summoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.60,0:27:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来和我兄弟分享胜利的喜悦!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come to share drink with my partner in victory!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表达下你的敬意就走吧 他需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, pay your respects and be gone, he needs rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.03,0:27:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再让他喝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And keep that fucking wine from his lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:01.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟 没有你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without you, brother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.83,0:28:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洒落在竞技场的就不是雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my blood would have fallen in the arena{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是我的血了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}instead of the rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.73,0:28:10.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿神灵永远以Crixus为荣 战无不胜的高卢人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods forever honor Crixus, the Undefeated Gaul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.93,0:28:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原谅我带来的伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And forgive the pain I cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.76,0:28:28.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move aside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.83,0:28:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的伤口又裂开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His wound has reopened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.03,0:28:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把褐色的罐子拿过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The brown jar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.03,0:28:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.16,0:28:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这能治愈他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will this heal him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.36,0:28:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.76,0:28:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但能让他镇定下来睡着 这样我就能缝合伤口了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it will calm him to sleep so that I may seal the wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.43,0:28:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will he be all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快滚出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get the fuck out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.80,0:29:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经喝太多了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had too much wine already...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.03,0:29:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很值得尝尝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是费乐年葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Falernian,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.06,0:29:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从没从此痛饮过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}none of that swill flowing below us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 确实太爽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Um, it truly tastes of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.66,0:29:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快赶上神仙的生活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And brings us closer to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:19.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca怎样了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How fares Barca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.90,0:29:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精神不错 和其他所有人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fine spirits, as are all the men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.76,0:29:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你值得信任吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is your confidence to be trusted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.40,0:29:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, of course Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几天前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Several days ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.96,0:29:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被迫去收拾那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was forced to take retribution against Ovidius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,粮商Ovidius\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the grain merchant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他试图在地下赌场取我的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He had made attempt on my life in the pits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个威胁 不可信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man was a danger and not to be trusted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.86,0:29:37.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要好好教训下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he had to be handled accordingly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.10,0:29:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.43,0:29:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在到处都是留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now rumors abounds that more than Ovidius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.66,0:29:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不止Ovidius被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}gave up their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.66,0:29:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他全家人 都被屠杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His entire family, slain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面甚至还有个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was even a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.10,0:29:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人 我可以不在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rest I can put from mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但对那个男孩 我很关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the boy, he troubles my conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果Barca执行了我的命令 做出了如此行为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Barca exceeded my orders and laid hand to such an act...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.83,0:29:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他没有杀那个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, he didn't kill the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.73,0:29:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许 你只是迎合我才这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you only tell me what I wish to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.90,0:29:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.66,0:30:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He told me so himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.83,0:30:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他发誓 他没有伤害那个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He swore he'd never harm a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那这样 就不必受到良心谴责了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well this gives reason to put conscience to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.73,0:30:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道了 会很高兴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll be so pleased to know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要隐瞒他一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll keep it from him yet a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.83,0:30:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想用如此肮脏的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not wish to taint the celebration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.90,0:30:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玷污此次庆典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with such dark thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.20,0:30:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的坦诚以待 Pietros\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for your honesty, Pietros.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.93,0:30:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那男人的本性已暴露无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The true nature of the man is revealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.83,0:30:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想不到他会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have thought it of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先让Barca快活一会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let Barca hoist his cup a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.00,0:30:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他的理智被酒灌晕的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When his wits are damp with wine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.16,0:30:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再好好奖励他的"忠诚"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I will see him rewarded for his loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.46,0:31:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你浑身酒味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You smell of wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.76,0:31:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来庆祝的 还带了酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bring cups, full of celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.49,0:31:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我敬佩你的胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I honor your victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.93,0:31:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正祷告着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With prayer. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我才有可能和妻子团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your instruction made possible reunion with my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.83,0:31:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万分感激 敬您一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would raise cups in gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.33,0:31:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心意我领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sentiment is well received.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.69,0:31:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我已经多年不沾酒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But wine has not passed my lips for many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为信仰吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your gods forbid it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:49.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.79,0:31:55.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是原则问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a matter of discipline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura也常这样警告我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura always cautioned toward the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贤惠的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wise woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.56,0:32:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与丈夫相隔万里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far beyond the station of her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.13,0:32:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我的生命没有她的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she had not come into my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.83,0:32:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是要回来了嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now she returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.86,0:32:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是神明保佑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods have truly blessed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.16,0:32:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura也会这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura would say the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.66,0:32:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是跟神对着干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods and I do not tread common ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.56,0:32:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然她多次劝我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although she made effort many times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要大逆不道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to place us at even footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.63,0:32:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好个通情达理的贤惠女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wise and understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱一个人 就爱他的全部...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To love a man despite his shortcomings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.13,0:32:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我活下去的唯一理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is the only reason my heart beats within my chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尘世间还能有这样的爱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To find love such as this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.93,0:32:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几辈子修来的福分啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A rare and fortunate thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很清楚啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak from knowledge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.13,0:32:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有妻室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wife of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.20,0:32:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的关怀 一直让我念念不忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The thought of her ever upon my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.93,0:32:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还活着吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does she live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.49,0:32:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活在我记忆中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.23,0:33:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想见她一面啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have desired to meet her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.23,0:33:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要告诉她 你是个好丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tell her of her husband's worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.46,0:33:15.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打断你的祷告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for disturbing your prayers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.73,0:33:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.03,0:33:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于胜利而言 我不能喝这杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot drink to victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.53,0:33:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但于你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But to your wife,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.30,0:33:33.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有她要回来的喜悦...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and her joyous return...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这会就别提什么原则了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Discipline gives way to the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.90,0:33:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们敬您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.33,0:34:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦 主人都说什么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow, what did the Dominus require?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.23,0:34:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么重要的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing of import...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.40,0:34:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吻我别有用心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You kiss with purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是自由之念啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the thought of freedom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.70,0:34:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能容我 插句话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word, if I may.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没带钱来的话 就闭嘴滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck your words, unless coupled with coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.60,0:35:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还真来对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very matter I came to discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.66,0:35:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从Marcellus那儿借到了一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've secured a sizeable loan from good Marcellus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够顶上你的赌金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to cover your winnings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.19,0:35:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过利息要得有点离谱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The terms of interest were outrageous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.03,0:35:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.29,0:35:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等今早 Marcellus凑齐了 就会带来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marcellus will bring it when he collects his whore, in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.60,0:35:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没有 你还来打扰老子快活?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You interrupt my cock with empty hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.06,0:35:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有别的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus知道你渴望自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus knows of your desire for freedom,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.33,0:35:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要趁热打铁 尽早说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and makes noise for discussing terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.06,0:35:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在竞技场上的表现 让人印象深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your skills, while impressive in the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在谈判这事上 您还差点哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lack a certain gentle touch in the art of negotiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.03,0:35:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我能和Batiatus通融一下 给你的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can offer to bargain a better price from Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,争取个好价钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.93,0:35:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你的钱 差不多一半就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Half the difference to be subtracted from my debt to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.60,0:35:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus 还是挺通情达理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus is in agreeable spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快去吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we move with haste...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.13,0:35:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 最后一次叫他主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go and call him Dominus, for the final time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.23,0:36:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说 你想要离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear whispers you seek freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.23,0:36:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次讨论 Ashur代表我发言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur represents me in the discussion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.33,0:36:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨论?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Discussion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.53,0:36:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么好说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's none to be had in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.33,0:36:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你胆敢违背我的那刻起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bond between master and slave has already been dissolved...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.56,0:36:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我就已经不是主人和奴隶的关系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the moment you disobeyed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.06,0:36:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违背?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Disobeyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.16,0:36:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ovidius的儿子还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The son of Ovidius lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.73,0:36:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.33,0:36:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官正十万火急地找他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Magistrate rides to retrieve him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.26,0:36:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要那小子还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet breathing, small fingers trembling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.83,0:36:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终究会找到我的头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to reveal the beast that took away his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:36:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This cannot be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.96,0:37:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我亲手扼住他的咽喉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hands upon his throat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看着他死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I felt the life flee from his body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的小情人可不是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your lover spoke otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.23,0:37:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pietros吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pietros?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.13,0:37:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉他男孩还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You told him the boy lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.13,0:37:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.33,0:37:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.93,0:37:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是为了安抚他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But only to calm him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.50,0:37:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他知道 孩子是我杀的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he knew the child's blood stained my hands...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你是骗他的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you lied to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.93,0:37:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许现在 他在骗您呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or he lies to you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.09,0:37:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论怎样 我已经不相信你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Either way, we've a serious issue of trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.86,0:37:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人 听我解...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus, let me expl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.19,0:37:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well, stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you're free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.19,0:40:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca赎回了自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca purchased his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.23,0:40:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们送他出门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We wished him well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.43,0:40:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝他一路好走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and escorted him through the gates of the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.19,0:40:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么说 明白了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.06,0:40:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.43,0:40:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真记住了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.40,0:40:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.60,0:40:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:40:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juno's cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.86,0:41:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是谁啊?!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What now?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.06,0:41:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for the Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.33,0:41:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了!?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck!?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把窗帘拉上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Close the curtains!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.06,0:41:06.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Santos 把血迹清理干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Santos clean the blood up in there,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.06,0:41:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快弄干净!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}get it cleaned up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.06,0:41:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.09,0:41:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Batiatus出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Batiatus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.56,0:41:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.03,0:41:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您来得真不巧啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You call at unexpected hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.89,0:41:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没时间跟你耗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drawn by matters that will not wait for dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.36,0:41:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么又见血了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What new offense is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.03,0:41:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.06,0:41:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不听话的奴隶 教训了几下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A disobedient slave, freshly corrected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.66,0:41:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要受皮肉之苦的 可不止他一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the only wretch deserving of blood this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.63,0:41:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去见Ovidius的儿子 刚回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have just now returned from the promised reunion with Ovidius' son,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.29,0:41:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有话要问你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would have words with a man seen in your house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.73,0:41:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说的是哪个人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which man do you speak of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.36,0:41:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个骗了我的信使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The messenger that filled my heart with false hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.40,0:41:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信使?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Messenger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.33,0:41:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本没人见过Ovidius的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ovidius' child was not seen on any road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.96,0:41:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Returning to the city,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.09,0:41:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我堂弟家的废墟里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we had news that his body was discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.36,0:41:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才找到孩子的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}among the ashes of my cousin's villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.93,0:41:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是信使撒了谎...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The messenger lied...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.13,0:41:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真不该随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have knowledge of the reason,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.56,0:41:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听信一个傻瓜的谎话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}along with the fool's tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.96,0:42:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定不惜代价 把这个混蛋抓来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every effort will be exhausted until the villain is discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.83,0:42:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.19,0:42:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Paired with gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.09,0:42:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信使让你达成心愿了 对不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The messenger had the desired effect, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.23,0:42:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于安心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My concerns have been laid to rest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.86,0:42:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用怕被Barca拖死 也不用还他钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sharing grave with Barca and his thirst for winnings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.46,0:42:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政官应该不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no chance the Magistrate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.60,0:42:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查到消息的来源吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will deduce the source of this message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.96,0:42:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要阎王不开口 没人知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not unless Hades speaks of it from the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.29,0:42:28.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信使已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The messenger has been put to grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.23,0:42:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是敢再提起这事 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you will follow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.56,0:42:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕一个字 下一个死的就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if a word of this transaction parts your lips again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我屎都吐出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shit myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.03,0:42:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:52.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ashur啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ashur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.06,0:42:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 小Pietros!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Young Pietros!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.36,0:42:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How does the day find you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心了整个晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the night, filled with worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.06,0:42:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca一直没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barca never returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.06,0:42:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor will he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.06,0:42:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经自由啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.06,0:43:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.06,0:43:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.06,0:43:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经从主人那儿赎身了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Purchased from our Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他走的时候 我追都追不上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could barely keep pace as we saw him to the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.29,0:43:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要带我一起的啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was to take me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.06,0:43:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩的自由 价钱可不低啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The price of freedom was too steep for the both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.86,0:43:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别担心啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But do not worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.13,0:43:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Barca一定还能找到一个 比你更嫩的美男的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure Barca will find another tight hole to sit on his cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.29,0:43:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不用花钱呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One he doesn't have to pay for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.29,0:43:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我头还晕着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jupiter's cock, my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.73,0:43:47.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶心得我都站不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can barely stand for want of vomit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是唯一一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're in large company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.53,0:43:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种情况 谁能把持住啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one in condition to halt a man of purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.13,0:43:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要的就是这效果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such by design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.63,0:44:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平常 Doctores可是太阳没升起来 就开始挥鞭子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctores usually up before the sun, whip in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.60,0:44:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还会起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will he ever rise again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.86,0:44:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.66,0:44:05.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那是几个时辰之后的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But not for many hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.03,0:44:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 那你的把握就更大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, your chances improve, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.99,0:44:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是必然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the point of certainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.73,0:44:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会这么顺利的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing is ever so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.36,0:44:14.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你逃出门去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look even if you ride beyond the gates,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.73,0:44:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守卫也会紧追不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the guards will pursue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.03,0:44:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不会这样做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will be commanded against such action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.63,0:44:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还指望他们听你的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You actually expect them to obey you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.50,0:44:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.66,0:44:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只希望他们能听主人的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I expect them to obey their master...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.09,0:44:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妈的给我把剑放下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drop your fucking swords!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.16,0:44:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.03,0:44:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到了山阴 我就会放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will release him when we are in the cover of the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.53,0:44:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.03,0:44:41.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妻子的车快到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife's cart appears upon the road!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.80,0:44:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll be with you presently!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.89,0:44:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次提醒你 慎重考虑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I urge you to reconsider one last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.23,0:44:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sura一定要自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sura will be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.70,0:44:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今生 或是来世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In this life, or the one after,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.23,0:44:56.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依偎在她的丈夫身边...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with her husband by her side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.43,0:45:05.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿神明保佑你们能重回色雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods see you both upon the plains of Thrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.99,0:45:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,池子现在干净了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pool is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.23,0:45:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像没发生过一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As if it never happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.33,0:45:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是误会 令人悔之不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A regrettable misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.66,0:45:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到死 他都是忠诚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man was yet loyal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.89,0:45:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他渴望自由啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wished for his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这本身就是对我们的背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A betrayal in itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.73,0:45:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.80,0:45:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找点乐子去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To happier thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.99,0:45:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个色雷斯人的老婆到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Thracian's wife approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.66,0:45:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不得高兴坏了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is that cause for cheer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.26,0:45:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的到来 只会让他想起过去的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her arrival will only remind him of his old life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.36,0:45:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和行尸走肉般的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the ways of an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么就不明白呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.46,0:45:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的希望和命运 已经和斯巴达克斯拴在一起了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our hopes and fortunes are tied to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.83,0:45:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承诺让他和妻子团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made a promise to reunite him with his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.76,0:46:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让他死心塌地 我不能食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In honor of the man, I will keep my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.03,0:49:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来的路上... 不知从哪冒出来一群人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They came out of nowhere... on the road...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.16,0:49:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们... 他们袭击了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they attacked... they attacked on the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.16,0:51:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My word is kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.76,0:51:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们团聚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're reunited.{\r}
